&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">正在读取软件包列表... 完成
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">E: 无法下载 http://mirror.rise.ph/ubuntu/dists/focal-updates/main/dep11/Components-amd64.yml.xz 文件尺寸不符&lt;span class="o">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="m">264288&lt;/span> !&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> 264484&lt;span class="o">)&lt;/span>。您使用的镜像正在同步中？ &lt;span class="o">[&lt;/span>IP: 43.226.6.79 80&lt;span class="o">]&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> Hashes of expected file:
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> - Filesize:264484 &lt;span class="o">[&lt;/span>weak&lt;span class="o">]&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> - SHA256:ea09acc6bddd6a503a3812ba1d3a025e5515c5469dcad172c86e2bda6f203752
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> - SHA1:60863a9cc3181eb87007edcfc2de1ba6a0b81a5f &lt;span class="o">[&lt;/span>weak&lt;span class="o">]&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> - MD5Sum:80baa34a1b24d245341757fa51ebd29e &lt;span class="o">[&lt;/span>weak&lt;span class="o">]&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> Release file created at: Sat, &lt;span class="m">27&lt;/span> Feb &lt;span class="m">2021&lt;/span> 08:09:39 +0000
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">E: 部分索引文件下载失败。如果忽略它们，那将转而使用旧的索引文件。
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 解决办法&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">sudo rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/partial/
